{"summary": "w2 实现 src/report.py 的 describe，仅调用 geometry.area/perimeter，格式固定为 kind: area=.. perimeter=..", "findings": ["w1 承诺保持 area/perimeter 名称与签名不变，report 可安全依赖", "describe 不自行计算几何，未知 kind 由 geometry 抛 ValueError", "格式字符串使用 :.2f 保证两位小数"], "edits": [{"path": "src/report.py", "base_sha256": "cb62c807e3ec7131777b0fea967d74e050ec6a83d218fc70c41a6a57aa8bd956", "content": """"Report rendering (depends on geometry)."""
from .geometry import area, perimeter


def describe(shape):
    return (
        f"{shape['kind']}: "
        f"area={area(shape):.2f} "
        f"perimeter={perimeter(shape):.2f}"
    )
"}]}
